                                What is <span class="curve-text">Real Estate</span> Tokenization?
                            </h2>
                            <p class="nw-w-txt-2 text-center mb-3" style="color: #0000008f;" data-aos="fade-up">Clarisco
                                Real estate tokenization is the process of converting ownership rights in physical
                                property, such as residential, commercial, industrial, or land, into blockchain-based
                                digital tokens. Each token represents a verifiable fractional share of the underlying
                                real estate asset, recorded immutably on-chain.
                            </p>
                            <p class="nw-w-txt-2 text-center mb-5" style="color: #0000008f;" data-aos="fade-up">
                                As a leading real estate tokenization development company, Clarisco Solutions builds the
                                complete technical and legal stack for your property token through SPV formation,
                                ERC-3643 or ERC-1400 smart contracts, investor onboarding portal, KYC/AML automation,
                                rent distribution engine, and secondary market integration
                            </p>

